SUMMARY:Lab & Play ! - Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Facilitator DJ SeigeA (CJ O
 'Reilly)
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, September 20th\n1st Da
 nce Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Danc
 e Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilit
 ator DJ SeigeA (CJ O'Reilly)\n\nIntention: Lab & Play!\n\nWhat happens whe
 n we open up to letting go of the results and seeing what happens? Let's e
 xperiment! Let's play!\n\n## About CJ O'Reilly\n\nCJ O'Reilly has been cre
 ating ecstatic dance waves for the Asheville community since 2014. Their e
 clectic mix of musical styles beckons dancers into new patterns of movemen
 t and expression through diverse time signatures and instrumentation\, and
  a wide range of musical and emotive qualities. CJ's waves explore high pe
 aks\, beautiful vistas\, juicy lowlands and the profound reflective stilln
 ess of tranquil water. CJ's dance waves are pre-produced and refined throu
 gh the body and ears of a dancer and audiophile.\nFind more of DJ SeigeA's
  dance waves at [https://dj.seigea.com](https://dj.seigea.com)\n\\~\\~\\~\
 n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close pr
 omptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Pleas
 e be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices:
  $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nP
 re-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Voluntee
 r and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovemen
 tcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunt
 eer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lk
