 e Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilit
 ator Ted Riskin\n\nIntention: The Attention Economy\n\nWhat do we pay when
  we pay attention?\n\n## About Ted Riskin\n\nTed is interested in anything
  that can get him out of his head\, and music and movement do a pretty goo
 d job of that. He hopes to offer music that facilitates an inner journey a
 nd invitations that create a shift. While he likes modern electronic music
 \, he can’t create a mix without including lots of natural instruments a
 nd voices. Due to a short attention span\, he mixes in lots of different m
 usical genres. You can hear some of his mixes on [https://www.mixcloud.com
 /tarisk/](https://www.mixcloud.com/tarisk/)\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please no
 te that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening C
 ircle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ens
 ure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name 
 your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Rec
